{
    "word": "overcall",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "412398d0-7bc9-3bf4-8e71-2c811bcc1f13",
                "word": "overcall",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2f2cd34f-c39e-43e2-a772-d341e9bd8eb8",
                        "entry_id": "412398d0-7bc9-3bf4-8e71-2c811bcc1f13",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "overcalls"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a7408a1d-8601-3505-b4e8-66b6b7b69e04",
                        "entry_id": "412398d0-7bc9-3bf4-8e71-2c811bcc1f13",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A call which occurs after another player has already called"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "80fb3609-94a6-3c9c-aeea-0a419a032e37",
                        "entry_id": "412398d0-7bc9-3bf4-8e71-2c811bcc1f13",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An additional contribution required of investors beyond the initial investment, should unforeseen expenses arise."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0974ea16-c43a-4f4a-a3c6-d72f06cbfdf1",
                                "sense_id": "80fb3609-94a6-3c9c-aeea-0a419a032e37",
                                "text": "Respondent further asserts that the only reason the overcall provision was included in the partnership agreement was to circumvent the provisions of section 465."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b98d892b-e7ee-4db1-b645-8820a9325774",
                                "sense_id": "80fb3609-94a6-3c9c-aeea-0a419a032e37",
                                "text": "For the purposes of the Contract, \"Production Costs\" shall mean the estimated costs of producing the Principal Company (including any contingency reserves), as described in the documents used in connection with the financing of such Company, including costs that may be paid, if permitted by the terms of such documents, by an overcall demand on investors, but not including any weekly expenses."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d0ef965-3b5d-47c3-aae0-ecc36452aa60",
                                "sense_id": "80fb3609-94a6-3c9c-aeea-0a419a032e37",
                                "text": "On May 23, Levin drew up a suggested deal with CBS, whereby they would put up $300,000 plus an overcall of 20 percent ($60,000); CBS would get the rights to televise the show, while the stage version would get television and radio publicity, with the possibility of television coverage of the opening night."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eef23411-5651-30d5-9c94-e0b837cae9d1",
                        "entry_id": "412398d0-7bc9-3bf4-8e71-2c811bcc1f13",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An extra amount called up beyond the minimum required."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1a9571a-a56e-434b-8d3e-a9d6b3970d40",
                                "sense_id": "eef23411-5651-30d5-9c94-e0b837cae9d1",
                                "text": "An overcall should be arranged with Corps Area Headquarters so that a sufficient number of men will be physically examined to produce the net specified on the order referred to above."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "38153039-b309-4c72-94e4-c999d5a2d50e",
                                "sense_id": "eef23411-5651-30d5-9c94-e0b837cae9d1",
                                "text": "It has been noted that in some States the Negro overcall percentage has been the same as the white overcall percentage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0946e071-69d9-4b3b-b5a4-50f479de441c",
                                "sense_id": "eef23411-5651-30d5-9c94-e0b837cae9d1",
                                "text": "Was the overcall made with the intent of depriving nonintegrated users aluminum from the new facilities?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cad4c122-ccd6-3172-9e68-2b3939c55057",
                        "entry_id": "412398d0-7bc9-3bf4-8e71-2c811bcc1f13",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An additional creative product that a producer can require at the producer's option during the contract period."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "14616bf0-3bb2-4b24-bc10-dc025d3008ae",
                                "sense_id": "cad4c122-ccd6-3172-9e68-2b3939c55057",
                                "text": "Third, the nine-month period between delivery of the overcall recording and the expiration of that particular contract period can and should be reduced."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90cee061-2d6d-485d-997b-d0a69b2d6710",
                                "sense_id": "cad4c122-ccd6-3172-9e68-2b3939c55057",
                                "text": "Most majors require one album in each contract period, with the option to ask for a second, or overcall, album if they wish."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f08acee-3c00-439d-a45e-083902530d58",
                                "sense_id": "cad4c122-ccd6-3172-9e68-2b3939c55057",
                                "text": "Artists should always view contracts referring to overcall recordings with care, if not outright suspicion."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a814e650-a3e8-3112-b931-5eb48e30e569",
                        "entry_id": "412398d0-7bc9-3bf4-8e71-2c811bcc1f13",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A positive diagnosis when there is, in fact, nothing wrong."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c2e43dc-c3c7-4d86-a340-dfefbe6a4a32",
                                "sense_id": "a814e650-a3e8-3112-b931-5eb48e30e569",
                                "text": "According to published data, screening with chemiluminescence, as opposed to other light sources, imparts the lowest overcall rate."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90b6b961-8ca7-4597-a2f8-950bb8455b79",
                                "sense_id": "a814e650-a3e8-3112-b931-5eb48e30e569",
                                "text": "However, the rigid cores' appearance on smears and the intact reticulin fiber network on cell block will prevent the overcall."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae97f3ec-aeb9-4476-b45b-5739e0caabc0",
                                "sense_id": "a814e650-a3e8-3112-b931-5eb48e30e569",
                                "text": "A complete history may be important to avoid making an overcall, although cases of coexisting SQC and pemphigus vulgaris have been reported."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
